tab game | Gaming | sports_esports

sub sched | Game scheduling

tweak game.mmcss | sports_esports | rec
  name  Game & audio priority
  desc  Tunes the multimedia scheduler: reserves only 10% CPU for background work, turns off its lazy mode and gives the Games and Audio tasks high CPU, GPU and disk priority.
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile | SystemResponsiveness | d:10 | d:20
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile | SchedulerTimerResolution | d:10000 | -
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile | NoLazyMode | d:1 | -
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile | LazyModeTimeout | d:4294967295 | -
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile | SchedulerPeriod | d:1000000 | -
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile | IdleDetectionCycles | d:1 | -
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Games | Affinity | d:0 | d:0
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Games | Background Only | s:False | s:False
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Games | Clock Rate | d:10000 | d:10000
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Games | GPU Priority | d:8 | d:8
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Games | Priority | d:6 | d:2
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Games | Scheduling Category | s:High | s:Medium
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Games | SFIO Priority | s:High | s:Normal
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Audio | Affinity | d:0 | d:0
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Audio | Clock Rate | d:10000 | d:10000
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Audio | GPU Priority | d:8 | d:8
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Audio | Priority | d:6 | d:6
  R     NT\Multimedia\SystemProfile\Tasks\Audio | Scheduling Category | s:High | s:Medium

tweak game.anticheat | verified_user | rec
  name  Anti-cheat compatibility
  desc  Gives Vanguard (Valorant) and osu! the exploit-protection settings they expect, so they keep working when system-wide exploit protection is off.
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\vgc.exe | MitigationOptions | b:000000000001000000000000000000000000000000000000 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\vgc.exe | MitigationAuditOptions | b:000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\vgc.exe | EAFModules | s: | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\vgtray.exe | MitigationOptions | b:000000000001000000000000000000000000000000000000 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\valorant.exe | MitigationOptions | b:000000000001000000000000000000000000000000000000 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\VALORANT-Win64-Shipping.exe | MitigationOptions | b:000000000001000000000000000000000000000000000000 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\osu!.exe | MitigationOptions | b:000021000000000000000000000000000000000000000000 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\osu!.exe | MitigationAuditOptions | b:000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000000 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\osu!.exe | EAFModules | s: | -

tweak game.mode | sports_esports | rec
  name  Game Mode
  desc  Keeps Game Mode on, so Windows pauses updates and background work and gives the game priority while you play.
  R     UM\GameBar | AutoGameModeEnabled | d:1 | -
  R     UM\GameBar | AllowAutoGameMode | d:1 | -

tweak game.fso | fullscreen | rec
  name  Fullscreen optimizations off
  desc  Turns off fullscreen optimizations, so games that ask for exclusive fullscreen really get it.
  R     HKCU\System\GameConfigStore | GameDVR_FSEBehaviorMode | d:2 | -
  R     HKCU\System\GameConfigStore | GameDVR_FSEBehavior | d:2 | -
  R     HKCU\System\GameConfigStore | GameDVR_HonorUserFSEBehaviorMode | d:1 | -
  R     HKCU\System\GameConfigStore | GameDVR_DXGIHonorFSEWindowsCompatible | d:1 | -
  R     HKCU\System\GameConfigStore | GameDVR_EFSEFeatureFlags | d:0 | -
  R     HKCU\System\GameConfigStore | GameDVR_DSEBehavior | d:2 | -

tweak game.flip | layers | rec
  name  Windowed game optimizations
  desc  Upgrades windowed and borderless DirectX 10/11 games to the flip presentation model, for lower latency and working VRR, and turns off the separate VRR optimization.
  R     UM\DirectX\UserGpuPreferences | DirectXUserGlobalSettings | s:VRROptimizeEnable=0;SwapEffectUpgradeEnable=1; | -

tweak game.apppref | rocket_launch | rec
  name  Game GPU & priority
  desc  Puts the games you have installed (Steam, Epic, Riot, Battle.net, Ubisoft, Roblox, osu! and any Unreal Engine game) on the high-performance GPU with High CPU priority, and Discord, Spotify and game launchers on the power-saving GPU, with launchers at Below normal priority. On laptops this keeps games on the dedicated GPU. Only installed games are touched.
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\Counter-Strike Global Offensive\game\bin\win64\cs2.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\dota 2 beta\game\bin\win64\dota2.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\Apex Legends\r5apex*.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege\RainbowSix*.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\Overwatch\Overwatch.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\Grand Theft Auto V\GTA5.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\Rust\RustClient.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\PUBG\TslGame\Binaries\Win64\TslGame.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\Call of Duty HQ\cod.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\FPSAimTrainer\FPSAimTrainer.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\Aimlabs\AimLab_tb.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\VRChat\VRChat.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %STEAM%\steamapps\common\*\*\Binaries\Win64\*-Win64-Shipping.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %ProgramFiles%\Epic Games\Fortnite\FortniteGame\Binaries\Win64\FortniteClient-Win64-Shipping.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %ProgramFiles%\Epic Games\rocketleague\Binaries\Win64\RocketLeague.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %ProgramFiles%\Epic Games\*\*\Binaries\Win64\*-Shipping.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %SystemDrive%\Riot Games\VALORANT\live\ShooterGame\Binaries\Win64\VALORANT-Win64-Shipping.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %SystemDrive%\Riot Games\League of Legends\Game\League of Legends.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Call of Duty\_retail_\cod.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Overwatch\_retail_\Overwatch.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Ubisoft\Ubisoft Game Launcher\games\Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege\RainbowSix*.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %ProgramFiles%\Genshin Impact\Genshin Impact Game\GenshinImpact.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %LOCALAPPDATA%\Roblox\Versions\*\RobloxPlayerBeta.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Roblox\Versions\*\RobloxPlayerBeta.exe
  GPUPREF 2 | %LOCALAPPDATA%\osu!\osu!.exe
  GPUPREF 1 | %LOCALAPPDATA%\Discord\app-*\Discord.exe
  GPUPREF 1 | %APPDATA%\Spotify\Spotify.exe
  GPUPREF 1 | %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Steam\steam.exe
  GPUPREF 1 | %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Steam\bin\cef\cef.win*\steamwebhelper.exe
  GPUPREF 1 | %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Epic Games\Launcher\Portal\Binaries\Win64\EpicGamesLauncher.exe
  GPUPREF 1 | %ProgramFiles(x86)%\Battle.net\Battle.net.exe
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\cs2.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\dota2.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\r5apex.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\r5apex_dx12.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\RainbowSix.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\RainbowSix_Vulkan.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\Overwatch.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\GTA5.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\RustClient.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\TslGame.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\cod.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\FPSAimTrainer.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\AimLab_tb.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\VRChat.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\FortniteClient-Win64-Shipping.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\RocketLeague.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\VALORANT-Win64-Shipping.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\GenshinImpact.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\RobloxPlayerBeta.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\osu!.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\League of Legends.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:3 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\steam.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:5 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\steamwebhelper.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:5 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\EpicGamesLauncher.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:5 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\EpicWebHelper.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:5 | -
  R     NT\Image File Execution Options\Battle.net.exe\PerfOptions | CpuPriorityClass | d:5 | -

sub capture | Game Bar & capture

tweak game.dvr | videocam_off | rec
  name  Game DVR & background recording off
  desc  Turns off Game DVR background recording, audio, cursor and microphone capture and the Game Bar presence writer that runs while you play.
  R     PW\GameDVR | AllowGameDVR | d:0 | -
  R     PW\GameDVR | AudioCaptureEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     PW\GameDVR | CursorCaptureEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     PW\GameDVR | MicrophoneCaptureEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     M\PolicyManager\default\ApplicationManagement\AllowGameDVR | value | d:0 | -
  R     M\WindowsRuntime\ActivatableClassId\Windows.Gaming.GameBar.PresenceServer.Internal.PresenceWriter | ActivationType | d:0 | d:1
  R     HKCU\System\GameConfigStore | GameDVR_Enabled | d:0 | d:1
  R     UCV\GameDVR | AppCaptureEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     UCV\GameDVR | HistoricalCaptureEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     UCV\GameDVR | AudioCaptureEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     UCV\GameDVR | CursorCaptureEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     UCV\GameDVR | MicrophoneCaptureEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     UM\GameBar | AppCaptureEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     UM\GameBar | EnableCaptureSampling | d:0 | -
  R     UM\GameBar\LiveCapture | ShowWatermark | d:0 | -
  R     UM\GameBar\LiveCapture | ShowTimer | d:0 | -
  R     UM\GameBar\LiveCapture | ShowBanner | d:0 | -
  R     UM\GameBar\Broadcast | AllowBroadcast | d:0 | -

tweak game.gamebar | gamepad | rec
  name  Game Bar pop-ups off
  desc  Stops the Game Bar tips and startup panel and stops the controller's Xbox button from opening Game Bar. Win+G still works.
  R     UM\GameBar | ShowStartupPanel | d:0 | -
  R     UM\GameBar | GamePanelStartupTipIndex | d:3 | -
  R     UM\GameBar | GamePanelStartupKeyAlignment | d:0 | -
  R     UM\GameBar | UseNexusForGameBarEnabled | d:0 | -
  R     UCV\GameDVR | ShowStartupPanel | d:0 | -
  R     UCV\GameDVR | UseNexusForGameBarEnabled | d:0 | -

sub input | Input latency

tweak game.mouse | mouse | rec logoff
  name  Mouse acceleration off
  desc  Turns off "Enhance pointer precision" and flattens the acceleration curve, so the cursor moves exactly as far as your hand does.
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | MouseSpeed | s:0 | s:1
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | MouseThreshold1 | s:0 | s:6
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | MouseThreshold2 | s:0 | s:10
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | SmoothMouseXCurve | b:0000000000000000C0CC0C0000000000809919000000000040662600000000000033330000000000 | -
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | SmoothMouseYCurve | b:0000000000000000000038000000000000007000000000000000A800000000000000E00000000000 | -

tweak game.mousefeel | ads_click | rec
  name  Pointer responsiveness
  desc  Shows hover tips after 100 ms, keeps double-click speed comfortable, and turns off pointer trails and snap-to-default-button.
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | MouseHoverTime | s:100 | s:400
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | DoubleClickSpeed | s:480 | s:500
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | MouseTrails | s:0 | s:0
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | SnapToDefaultButton | s:0 | s:0

tweak game.rawthrottle | mouse | rec
  name  Background raw input throttle
  desc  Limits raw mouse input to apps in the background (overlays, launchers) to every 20 ms, so the game in front gets the input first.
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | RawMouseThrottleEnabled | d:1 | -
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | RawMouseThrottleForced | d:1 | -
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | RawMouseThrottleDuration | d:20 | -
  R     HKCU\Control Panel\Mouse | RawMouseThrottleLeeway | d:0 | -

tweak game.devoff | developer_board_off | rec desktop
  name  Rarely used system devices off
  desc  Disables devices that are almost never used but still raise interrupts: the system speaker, COM1, the legacy GS wavetable synth, AMD controller emulation and crash defender, Intel platform monitoring and PCI RAM and data acquisition controllers.
  DEVOFF System Speaker|Communications Port (COM1)|Microsoft GS Wavetable Synth|AMD Controller Emulation|AMD Crash Defender|Intel(R) Platform Monitoring Technology Device|Legacy device|PCI Data Acquisition and Signal Processing Controller|PCI standard RAM Controller

tweak game.rit | mouse | rec
  name  Raw input timer coalescing off
  desc  Stops the raw input thread from batching mouse and keyboard timer work to save power.
  R     NT\Windows | RITdemonTimerPowerSaveElapse | d:0 | -
  R     NT\Windows | RITdemonTimerPowerSaveCoalescing | d:0 | -

tweak game.usbpower | usb | rec desktop reboot
  name  USB & PCI power saving off
  desc  Keeps USB controllers, hubs and devices awake: no selective suspend, link power management or D3cold. Mice, keyboards and headsets never fall asleep.
  R     CC\usbflags | DisableHCS0Idle | d:1 | -
  R     SV\USB | DisableSelectiveSuspend | d:1 | -
  R     SV\USBHUB3\Parameters | DisableLPM | d:1 | -
  R     SV\USBHUB3\Parameters | D3ColdSupported | d:0 | -
  R     SV\USBHUB3\Parameters | DisableSelectiveSuspendUI | d:1 | -
  R     SV\USBHUB3\Parameters | Ceip | d:0 | -
  R     SV\usbccgp\Parameters | D3ColdSupported | d:0 | -
  R     SV\pci\Parameters | D3ColdSupported | d:0 | -
  R     SV\pci\Parameters | D3ColdSupport | d:0 | -
  DEVZ  EnhancedPowerManagementEnabled AllowIdleIrpInD3 EnableSelectiveSuspend DeviceSelectiveSuspended SelectiveSuspendEnabled SelectiveSuspendOn D3ColdSupported WdfDirectedPowerTransitionEnable EnableIdlePowerManagement IdleInWorkingState
  DEVWAKE off
